WEBVTT

00:11:58.083 --> 00:12:02.393
make an intentional,
deliberate, ongoing effort

00:12:02.417 --> 00:12:05.333
to tune into what's good in your world.

00:12:06.292 --> 00:12:07.559
Number three,

00:12:07.583 --> 00:12:09.518
resilient people ask themselves,

00:12:09.542 --> 00:12:13.434
"Is what I'm doing helping or harming me?"

00:12:13.458 --> 00:12:17.351
This is a question that's used
a lot in good therapy.

00:12:17.375 --> 00:12:19.809
And boy, is it powerful.

00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:22.809
This was my go-to question

00:12:22.833 --> 00:12:25.226
in the days after the girls died.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:28.976
I would ask it again and again.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.018
"Should I go to the trial
and see the driver?